ter of conflict. Death of a", "conf": 0.895, "box": [[134, 637], [830, 642], [830, 668], [133, 663]]}, {"text": "Sultan normally resulted in civil war.", "conf": 0.905, "box": [[136, 663], [447, 668], [446, 691], [135, 687]]}, {"text": "2.", "conf": 0.658, "box": [[79, 702], [102, 702], [102, 726], [79, 726]]}, {"text": "Over the years,the empire had extended significantly. Without effective means of", "conf": 0.908, "box": [[136, 700], [838, 703], [838, 733], [136, 730]]}, {"text": "communication, it becamedifficult tokeepeffectivecontrolfrom thecentre.", "conf": 0.926, "box": [[138, 729], [781, 733], [781, 756], [137, 752]]}, {"text": "Pooradministration of revenue led to wide-scale corruption in the state affairs.This", "conf": 0.916, "box": [[136, 764], [840, 769], [840, 798], [135, 794]]}, {"text": "ultimatelyweakenedthesultanate.", "conf": 0.919, "box": [[140, 792], [445, 796], [444, 819], [139, 815]]}, {"text": "4.", "conf": 0.661, "box": [[81, 830], [107, 830], [107, 857], [81, 857]]}, {"text": "Nobles rebelled against weak rulers.", "conf": 0.91, "box": [[140, 831], [455, 834], [454, 858], [139, 854]]}, {"text": "5.", "conf": 0.506, "box": [[83, 870], [106, 870], [106, 894], [83, 894]]}, {"text": "Regionalstatesbecameverypowerful in15thcentury.Theyrefusedtopayrevenue", "conf": 0.923, "box": [[142, 871], [842, 875], [842, 898], [141, 894]]}, {"text": "and thus made it difficult for the center to keep control on them.", "conf": 0.914, "box": [[142, 896], [687, 899], [687, 923], [141, 920]]}, {"text": "6.", "conf": 0.645, "box": [[86, 935], [108, 935], [108, 959], [86, 959]]}, {"text": "Taimur's attack was a big blowto the rulers of Delhi and Babur's invasion proved to", "conf": 0.866, "box": [[143, 935], [842, 937], [842, 961], [142, 959]]}, {"text": "belastnail inthecoffinof Sultanate.", "conf": 0.92, "box": [[144, 961], [456, 962], [456, 985], [143, 984]]}, {"text": "Delhi Sultanate", "conf": 0.857, "box": [[407, 1024], [540, 1027], [540, 1050], [407, 1048]